 Limitations\n\n- This is generic bearing education only; it is not a specific-model repair instruction or a real fault identification.\n- The scenario cause is an independent teaching assumption, not an inferred or observed fact.\n- No actual operating facts, repair parameters, aviation suitability, equipment safety, or release decisions can be inferred from this material.\n- The evidence is a manufacturer's web page with no publication date, and review was by this round's agent against the original text, not by a second human or domain expert.\n- The available evidence is sufficient only for the limited educational explanation above; it is insufficient to say anything about the condition of a real bearing."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2993,"completion_tokens":489,"total_tokens":3482,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":2816},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":2816,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":177},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}